  "bodyHash": "25c5436799fae57e",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156128/description_34c2bcd1-b376-4c32-b8d9-9eea2990be78.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"109\"></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Sodium 已更新并移除了本模组挂钩的接口。鉴于我维护该模组的兴趣已经很低，且原本就计划在 Minecraft 转向 Vulkan 时将其归档，我决定现在停止开发。感谢大家一直以来的支持！任何想要尝试让模组重新工作的人都可以自行 Fork 它 :)</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组是&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbedrodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bedrodium</a>&nbsp;的分支，原作者为 kirillirik</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pC8HxhTPK3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/vesmaybevesper/substrate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fvesmaybevesper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsubstrate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/zNuzb72d?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=276538\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1156128?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156128/description_8dff9f9c-b32a-47a7-80b7-bfbe119a01bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"33\"></h2>\n<p><em><strong>需要 Sodium。</strong></em></p>\n<p>通过移除世界底层/顶层的不可见面来实现小幅优化。对玩家而言，这些面仅在必要时可见。（将删除主世界底部的多边形层，以及下界底部和顶部的多边形层）。虽然本模组以基岩为主题，但它并不会实际检查方块类型，即使在浮岛世界（例如小游戏服务器！）中也能提供优化效果。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9280455e1c94978a408dde3d6785bce2a4503d_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"300\"></a></p>",
